@meeting train.m9.halloran-emeka
// Pillar 5 Step 3, M9 tracing: the fallback when Calder isn't on shift (the by-list's second). Emeka Halloran gives
// you the pipe kit at the board. Seat M3 plays it. Head writer W2.
title: The pipe kit
from: Emeka Halloran
gist: Emeka gave you the pipe kit. Read the flow along a line; fine before and low after is your machine.
== lines
halloran-emeka: Morning, morning. The Chief left this for you. Your own pipe kit. Lovely.   [gesture]
halloran-emeka > you: Clip it to a panel and it reads the flow. Full, low, very low.
halloran-emeka: Showers on Four are weak. The trouble's somewhere on the water line. Not at the showers.
halloran-emeka: Start in the middle, the Deck 5 pumps. Fine there? Go downstream. Then halve it again.
halloran-emeka: Fine before a machine, low after it. That's the one. Off you go. I'll walk with you.
